    ]
  },
  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "Michael D. Polensek built one of Cleveland's longest city-council careers representing northeast neighborhoods including Collinwood, North Shore Collinwood, Collinwood Village, and East Glenville. His work emphasized public safety, fair housing, neighborhood equity, lakefront access, arts and entertainment development, and grassroots organizations, reflecting Slovenian heritage and local civic service."
    ]
